                <pb facs="0773" n="671" sameAs="frus:frus1919v01/pg671"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">693.119/271: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Reinsch</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-05-21T18:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 21, 1919, 6
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Your May 17, 7 p.m.</p>
                <p>Matter will be taken up with Italian Government.</p>
                <p>In the meantime you may confer with your colleagues with a view to persuading the
                    Italian representative to recommend to his Government that the exception be
                    withdrawn. Uniformity of action is most essential.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
